0..76 Comment "//! The identity subject\'s shared declarations, written once and imported by"
77..155 Comment "//! every source that reads them (`import \"./circle-base.gandr\" ;`): the empty"
156..227 Comment "//! type, the circle, the presented integers and the free naturals, the"
228..307 Comment "//! winding number and spinning with their round trips (the book\'s § 8.1), and"
308..386 Comment "//! the maps out of the circle the circle sources state their laws over, after"
387..460 Comment "//! cubical Agda\'s `Cubical/HITs/S1/Base.agda`. `circle.gandr` states the"
461..534 Comment "//! equivalence `winding` the round trips make and what it computes; this"
535..579 Comment "//! source states only what the others read."
