2423..2497 Comment "/// Spinning undoes winding at every loop (cubical\'s `decodeEncode` at the"
2498..2572 Comment "/// point): the round trip at a variable, by induction over the words. The"
2573..2651 Comment "/// result type reads the word the fold descends on, so each arm answers it at"
2652..2723 Comment "/// its letter and the recursive call at the rest: `sect[<](q)` relates"
2724..2799 Comment "/// `spin(wind(q))` to `q`, and carried along `loopOn` it relates `loop ∷"
2800..2880 Comment "/// spin(wind(q))`, which `spin(wind(loop ∷ q))` runs to, to `loop ∷ q`. The"
2881..2957 Comment "/// case respects the cancellations: at `loop ∷ back(loop) ∷ q` the arms"
2958..3034 Comment "/// compose to `cong(loopOn, cong(unloopOn, p))`, whose functions compose to"
3035..3107 Comment "/// the identity under the words\' rules, so the chain is `p` itself, the"
3108..3126 Comment "/// answer at `q`."
